    rdfs:label "'] \\& \\& tikzcd% Absorption closure: cannon witnesses and generated witnesses both reach published claims only through the Music olog governance step. The two absorption paths commute at the olog node.fig:music-absorption-closure Diagram law (Figure~fig:music-absorption-closure): the two witness paths commute at \\(MusicOlog\\); a cannon phrase that reaches \\(PublishedClaim\\) without passing through the olog is an unabsorbed shortcut. [0.88]% tikzcd[column sep=large,row sep=large,ampersand replacement=\\&] |[processnode]| MusicEngine [r," .
